{"uid":"a5987af8d1f078fc","name":"test_both_lexical_rewrite_fallbacks_are_themselves_legal","fullName":"tests.test_legal_rewrite_reprompt#test_both_lexical_rewrite_fallbacks_are_themselves_legal","historyId":"5960515e2021428c327adb43e805d2d2","time":{"start":1791930881720,"stop":1791930881746,"duration":26},"description":"The far end of each ladder (used only if bounding or folding the\n    criteria still leaves it refused) is lint-clean, same discipline as\n    `test_every_shapes_own_default_rewrite_is_legal` above.\n\n    #209 defect 1 folds in THE losslessness guard, the single most\n    important line of that fix. Neither rewrite can return `None` once its\n    own lint has fired -- each ends its ladder on one of these two\n    constants -- and `_OVERRUN_REWRITE_FALLBACK` replaces the WHOLE\n    criteria, which is exactly \"a deletion dressed as a rewrite ... one\n    that quietly drops a deliverable\" (task 002's own recorded verdict on\n    its first attempt, the comment above that constant). Lint-clean as\n    advice is fine; APPLIED it destroys the criterion. So `repair_criteria`\n    must return `None` -- falling back to the plain refusal, which is only\n    wasteful -- whenever the computed rewrite IS either constant, and both\n    branches are reached by a real fixture here rather than asserted in\n    the abstract.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The far end of each ladder (used only if bounding or folding the<br />\ncriteria still leaves it refused) is lint-clean, same discipline as<br />\n<code>test_every_shapes_own_default_rewrite_is_legal</code> above.</p>\n<pre><code>#209 defect 1 folds in THE losslessness guard, the single most\nimportant line of that fix. Neither rewrite can return `None` once its\nown lint has fired -- each ends its ladder on one of these two\nconstants -- and `_OVERRUN_REWRITE_FALLBACK` replaces the WHOLE\ncriteria, which is exactly &quot;a deletion dressed as a rewrite ... one\nthat quietly drops a deliverable&quot; (task 002's own recorded verdict on\nits first attempt, the comment above that constant). Lint-clean as\nadvice is fine; APPLIED it destroys the criterion. So `repair_criteria`\nmust return `None` -- falling back to the plain refusal, which is only\nwasteful -- whenever the computed rewrite IS either constant, and both\nbranches are reached by a real fixture here rather than asserted in\nthe abstract.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791930548358,"stop":1791930548358,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791930548358,"stop":1791930548359,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791930881691,"stop":1791930881691,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791930881691,"stop":1791930881701,"duration":10},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791930881703,"stop":1791930881704,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791930881704,"stop":1791930881715,"duration":11},"sta